  <Geometry x:Key="MusicRepeatOne">M17 2 l4 4-4 4 M3 11v-1a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14 M7 22 l-4-4 4-4 M21 13v1a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3 M11 10h1v4</Geometry>
  <Geometry x:Key="MusicShuffle">M18 14 l4 4-4 4 M18 2 l4 4-4 4 M2 18h1.973a4 4 0 0 0 3.3-1.7l5.454-8.6a4 4 0 0 1 3.3-1.7H22 M2 6h1.972a4 4 0 0 1 3.6 2.2 M22 18h-6.041a4 4 0 0 1-3.3-1.8l-.359-.45</Geometry>
